ild all kind of  guns that you'll find all around the island. use the guns to kill zombies and all kinds of freaks that blocks your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your voodoo staff is your main healing source. use the right timing to heal your wounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your voodoo staff also makes your bullets. you'll have to choose between shooting and healing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kill foes and collect souls to refill your voodoo staff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >progress through the story to gain new abilities with the voodoo staff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no ammo pickups and no reloading required.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/3e50e17b5c02b54daba70d328219345d.avif?t=1753402889\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through\u00a0an island\u00a0 taken over by an evil necromancer, with allies you'll meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Voodoo Soldier is a\u00a0retro FPS with comic book inspired visuals and Haitian mythology. use guns to kill your foes while using your Voodoo staff to heal your wounds, dash, parry, and more. Manage your Voodoo energy as it serves for both your bullets and your Voodoo Staff.",
